  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• In a medium saucepan, melt the butter (for the rice) with a dash of olive oil over a medium heat. Add harissa paste and cook until fragrant, 1 minute. Add basmati rice, the water (for the rice) and vegetable stock pot. Stir to combine, then bring to the boil.\n• Reduce heat to low, then cover with a lid and cook for 10 minutes.\n• Remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and water is absorbed, 10 minutes. TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam, so don't peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61dd0f20219d460794245011/step-0dc0de80.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While rice is cooking, finely chop garlic. Halve cherry tomatoes. Grate carrot. Drain and rinse chickpeas.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil and 1/2 the garlic over a medium-high heat. Cook, stirring, until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Transfer garlic oil mixture to a small bowl. Add fetta cubes, mashing to combine. Stir in Greek-style yoghurt. Season with pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61dd0f20219d460794245011/step-69e86bef.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to a high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook chickpeas and carrot, stirring, until slightly golden and tender, 4-5 minutes. Reduce heat to medium. Add tomato paste, garlic & herb seasoning and remaining garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add the water (for the sauce) and butter (for the sauce). Simmer until thickened, 3-4 minutes. Season with salt and pepper to taste.\n• Meanwhile, combine baby spinach leaves, cherry tomatoes and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil in a medium bowl. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61dd0f20219d460794245011/step-4900a1c5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Roughly chop roasted almonds.\n• Divide harissa rice between bowls. Top with garlicky tomato chickpeas and a dollop of fetta-yoghurt sauce. Sprinkle with almonds.\n• Serve with salad.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61dd0f20219d460794245011/step-19421376.jpg"
    }
  ]
